      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Basically he told to use single agent but also mentioned that if one can add the self blind critique loop focused on one single component of the project and keep refining it , fable 5.2 works fine that way.\n\nHowever given the nature of how this model works , most time they tend to fight for which task will be handled by which sub agents and that messes things up.\n\nPersonally I have found single agent setup working great , if you put the hll instruction , rather than breaking down everything."
      },
